<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Stay Gold</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;A voice calls out from behind her. â€œYou really got to hit it.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œSorry!â€ Catra yelps, jumping off of the stool, nearly knocking it over as Adora rushes in front of her protectively, reaching one arm out and putting herself between Catra and the stranger in a well practiced motion. Catra put her hands behind her back, and looked down at the floor in shame.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Standing in front of her is a tall woman with dark skin and dyed, bluish white hair. Sheâ€™s cocking her hip, and her pierced left eyebrow is raised in confusion. Catra didnâ€™t even know eyebrows could be pierced. She thinks she wants one. â€œWhat are you apologizing for, kid?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œUh, touching the drums.â€ She responds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or, where Catra discovers the drums.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
